        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "除外アプリ"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "External server" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "外部サーバー"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "FIM-specialized, high quality" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "FIM特化、高品質"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fastest. Good on older Macs and 8 GB memory." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "最速。古いMacやメモリ8GBでも快適。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Follow these steps to get GhostType running across all your apps." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "以下の手順に従い、すべてのアプリでGhostTypeを有効にしてください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Font Size" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "フォントサイズ"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For code" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "コード向け"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For writing" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "文章向け"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "GUI, easy model management" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "GUI、簡単なモデル管理"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "General" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一般"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Generation" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "生成"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Get an API key" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "APIキーを取得"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ghost Text" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ゴーストテキスト"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "GhostType Settings" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "GhostType設定"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "GhostType connects to an OpenAI-compatible API server.\nStart your LLM in LM Studio, Ollama, or any compatible app before using." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "GhostTypeはOpenAI互換APIサーバーに接続します。\n使用前にLM Studio、Ollamaなどの対応アプリでLLMを起動してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "GhostType will not activate at all in these apps. IDEs and terminals are excluded by default (they have their own completions)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "これらのアプリではGhostTypeは一切動作しません。IDEやターミナルは独自の補完を持つため、既定で除外されています。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Grant both permissions above to enable system-wide completions." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "システム全体で補完を有効にするには、上記の両方の権限を許可してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Granted" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "許可済み"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Highest quality. Wants 16 GB memory or more." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "品質重視。メモリ16GB以上向け。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Holding Shift with the accept key always does the other one. Accepting a word at a time lets you stop partway through a long suggestion instead of deleting the rest." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Shiftを押しながら確定キーを押すと、常にもう一方が実行されます。1単語ずつ確定すれば、長い提案でも途中で止められるので、後から消す必要がありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Idle. Starts on your first keystroke." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "待機中。最初の打鍵で起動します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In these apps, auto-trigger is disabled. Use the manual trigger shortcut (%@) to request completions." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "これらのアプリでは自動トリガーが無効です。手動トリガーのショートカット(%@)で補完を呼び出してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inference" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "推論"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inference Backend" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "推論バックエンド"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inference error: %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "推論エラー: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Input Monitoring" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "入力監視"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Invalid URL" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "無効なURL"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Invalid response format from server" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "サーバーの応答形式が不正です"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keeps recent snippets of your own writing on this Mac and sends a few as context, so completions sound like you instead of like a generic assistant." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "あなたが書いた文章の断片をこのMac内に保存し、その一部を文脈として渡します。汎用的なアシスタント口調ではなく、あなたの書き方に寄った補完になります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keyboard Shortcuts" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "キーボードショートカット"
          }
        }
      }
    },
