          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ultra-lightweight, low latency" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "超軽量、低レイテンシ"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unconstrained" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "制約なし"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unknown" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "未確認"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Up to a few lines" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "数行まで"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use a hosted API with your own key. Your text leaves your Mac, and you pay the provider per request." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ホスト型APIを自分のキーで使います。文章はMacの外に出て、リクエストごとにプロバイダへの課金が発生します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use a server you already run: LM Studio, Ollama, llama.cpp, vLLM. No second copy of the weights." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "すでに動かしているサーバーを使います。LM Studio、Ollama、llama.cpp、vLLMなど。重みが二重に載りません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With a cloud provider, the text around your cursor is sent to that provider on every completion, and each one is billed to your key. Auto-trigger fires whenever you pause typing, so it is off by default here. Turn it on in General only if you have checked what that costs on your plan." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "クラウドを選ぶと、補完のたびにカーソル周辺の文章がプロバイダへ送信され、1回ごとにキーへ課金されます。自動補完は入力が止まるたびに発火するため、ここでは既定でオフにしています。プランでの費用を確認したうえで、必要なら「一般」でオンにしてください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Writing" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "あなたの文章"
          }
        }
      }
    },
